@startuml
title Product Offering Qualification

box "Mobile Network Operator"
participant "Product Order Capture & Validation;\nProduct Order Delivery\nOrchestration and Mgmt\n(for Business Partner)" as MNO_POC
participant "Delegate\nExposure" as MNO_DE
end box

box "Satellite Network Operator"
participant "Delegate\nExposure" as SNO_DE
participant "Product Configurator" as ProdConfig
participant "Party\nManagement" as PartyMgmt
participant "Agreement\nManagement" as AgreementMgmt
participant "Billing Account\nManagement" as BillingMgmt
participant "Location\nManagement" as LocationMgmt
participant "Product Catalog\nManagement" as ProductCatalogMgmt
end box

MNO_POC -> MNO_DE : 1. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\nPOST /queryProductOfferingQualification\n(instantSyncQualification=true\nplace=[country,locality,id],\nrelatedParty(id,name="MNO A",role="NTN Buyer",\nproductCharacteristic(name="NTNBand",value="n254";\nname="ChannelBandwidth",value="5MHz"))
MNO_DE -> SNO_DE : 2. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\nPOST /queryProductOfferingQualification\n((instantSyncQualification=true\nplace=[country,locality,id],\nrelatedParty(id,name="MNO A",role="NTN Buyer",\nproductCharacteristic(name="NTNBand",value="n254";\nname="ChannelBandwidth",value="5MHz"))
SNO_DE -> ProdConfig : 3. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\nPOST /queryProductOfferingQualification\n((instantSyncQualification=true\nplace=[country,locality,id],\nrelatedParty(id,name="MNO A",role="NTN Buyer",\nproductCharacteristic(name="NTNBand",value="n254";\nname="ChannelBandwidth",value="5MHz"))

group resolve party
ProdConfig -> PartyMgmt : 4. TMF632 Party Mgt\nGET /organization/356
PartyMgmt --> ProdConfig : 5. TMF632 Party Mgt\n200 OK(organization(\nagreement="ag458",\nsettlementAccount="sa1293"))
end

group resolve agreement
ProdConfig -> AgreementMgmt : 6. TMF651 Agreement Mgt\nGET /agreement/ag458
AgreementMgmt --> ProdConfig : 7. TMF651 Agreement Mgt\n200 OK(agreement())
end

group resolve settlement account
ProdConfig -> BillingMgmt : 8. TMF666 Account Mgt\nGET /settlementAccount/sa1293
BillingMgmt --> ProdConfig : 9. TMF666 Account Mgt\n200 OK(settlementAccount())
end

alt resolve places refs from address data
ProdConfig -> LocationMgmt : 10. TMF673 Geographic Address\nGET /geographicAddress?\n(country="CountryA",locality="Region1";\ncountry="CountryA",locality="Region2";\nid="Polygon-34FTG1")
LocationMgmt --> ProdConfig : 11. TMF673 Geographic Address\n200 OK (list of places)
else resolve places refs from shape data
ProdConfig -> LocationMgmt : 12. TMF675 Geographic Location\nGET /geographicLocation?\n(type="polygon",\n"coordinates": [[[30,10],[40,40],[20,40],[10,20],[30,10]])
LocationMgmt --> ProdConfig : 13. TMF675 Geographic Location\n200 OK (list of places)
end

ProdConfig -> ProductCatalogMgmt : 14. TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt\nGET /productOffering?\nprodSpecCharValueUse=(name="NTNBand",value="n254";\nname="ChannelBandwidth",value="5MHz")
ProductCatalogMgmt --> ProdConfig : 15. TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt\n200 OK(filtered eligible offerings,\npolicies/rules applied to ProductOfferings, ProductOfferingPrices:\nrestrict the availability of a product offering accordingly,\nproduct offering price as condition dependent price,\nplaces references)

note over ProdConfig
  Performs filtering:
  Agreement is valid, has regional restrictions
  Settlement Account state is eligible
  Offering is valid for place/location
  Offering SLA permitted for location
  Commercial policy and geo restrictions
  Regulatory constraints (landing rights)
  One-hop static range
end note

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 16. Build a list of eligible offerings\n(conditional Wholesale NTN Cell Capacity),\nCalculate prices

ProdConfig --> SNO_DE : 17. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\n200 OK (list of qualifiedProductOfferingItems)\nconditional Wholesale NTN Cell Capacity
SNO_DE --> MNO_DE : 18. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\n200 OK (list of qualifiedProductOfferingItems)\nconditional Wholesale NTN Cell Capacity
MNO_DE --> MNO_POC : 19. TMF679 Product Offering Qualification\n200 OK (list of qualifiedProductOfferingItems)\nconditional Wholesale NTN Cell Capacity
@enduml
